WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.620
Payments. Reminders. Registrations. Contracts. Attendance.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.580
Schedules. Messages. Reports.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.840
Eight jobs. And only two hands.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.740
So the admin waits until night.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:19.180
After the last class, the owner is still chasing payments and answering parents.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.180
What if you had eight arms?

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:27.560
That is ExoClass. One system for your whole enrichment centre.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:31.770
Parents register online, and see free spots live.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.930
Groups and schedules live in one place.

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.290
Invoices go out on their own, with payment reminders,

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:40.250
and parents pay by card.

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:43.810
Contracts are signed online with ExoSign.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.890
Teachers mark attendance in one tap.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:50.530
Messages reach every parent through ExoSend.

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:55.050
Parents manage their own bookings, and you see revenue at a glance.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:59.970
Less chasing. Less admin. More time for teaching.

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:03.840
ExoClass was built inside Robotics Academy,

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:07.360
which runs clubs for more than 10,000 children a year.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:11.670
Built since 2021, launched in 2023.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:16.780
Today, more than 70 providers across 11 activity types run on it.

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:20.850
Next on our roadmap: an AI assistant.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.940
Eight jobs. One system. ExoClass.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:27.260
We are looking for partners in Singapore.
